# deploy/.env is AUTO-GENERATED — never create or edit it by hand.
#
#   just deploy-env
#
# regenerates it from its two sources:
#   deploy/env.config        tracked, NON-SECRET configuration (edit this file)
#   secrets/*.sops.json      sops-encrypted secrets (edit with `sops secrets/<file>.sops.json`)
#
# Every deploy path (just up / tunnel-provision / deploy-ic / verify-deploy / …) refreshes the
# file automatically when its sources changed and refuses to run when sops is unusable.
# Details: scripts/gen-deploy-env.sh, deploy/README.md.
